# Sledrun Halt (CIPlay vi_sledrun_halt; VI1 vehicle island): quest "Running on Empty", the five steps in order
island Sledrun Halt
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Running on Empty
expect hidden saddlebag
zone halt
expect step 1
read Halt board
expect step 2
kill Polar bear
expect animals Polar bear 0
expect step 3
use sled
expect message sits on empty
open Fuel locker
wait 2
expect story jerrycan 1
use sled
expect story sledfull 1
expect shown saddlebag
expect step 4
open Sled's saddlebag
wait 2
expect item HeadLight 1
expect done
